    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/f13ecfd0c7a18718cdf10396cea3c901.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and precise melee combat focused on parries, counter-attacks, and fluid chains. Encounters are built around timing, reflexes, and control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/2df5ea393b8ce20143723172139e11fe.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many elements in the environment can be sliced or destroyed. These interactions enhance both gameplay and immersion, creating tactical opportunities in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9fac3e691626b86da5c31eba678efc82.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades to enhance combat, hacking, or mobility. Activate Quantum Anomalies to slow down time through an overheat system, ideal for shifting the pace of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c561570c79b2ec5cb610787ee0b0aa98.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c561570c79b2ec5cb610787ee0b0aa98.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c561570c79b2ec5cb610787ee0b0aa98.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/8fc5a9812a6a1cb6cb06fe531c6c56b6.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of security cameras to observe, interact with, or manipulate the environment remotely. Disable defenses, open paths, and use hacking to access alternate routes across each level\u2019s dual-layered structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/bad61cb845b6a434acba7d48c1ecc1d2.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/bad61cb845b6a434acba7d48c1ecc1d2.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/bad61cb845b6a434acba7d48c1ecc1d2.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/f13ecfd0c7a18718cdf10396cea3c901.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and precise melee combat focused on parries, counter-attacks, and fluid chains. Encounters are built around timing, reflexes, and control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/2df5ea393b8ce20143723172139e11fe.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many elements in the environment can be sliced or destroyed. These interactions enhance both gameplay and immersion, creating tactical opportunities in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/9fac3e691626b86da5c31eba678efc82.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades to enhance combat, hacking, or mobility. Activate Quantum Anomalies to slow down time through an overheat system, ideal for shifting the pace of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c561570c79b2ec5cb610787ee0b0aa98.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c561570c79b2ec5cb610787ee0b0aa98.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/c561570c79b2ec5cb610787ee0b0aa98.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/8fc5a9812a6a1cb6cb06fe531c6c56b6.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of security cameras to observe, interact with, or manipulate the environment remotely. Disable defenses, open paths, and use hacking to access alternate routes across each level\u2019s dual-layered structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/bad61cb845b6a434acba7d48c1ecc1d2.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/bad61cb845b6a434acba7d48c1ecc1d2.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/bad61cb845b6a434acba7d48c1ecc1d2.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
